        "wer": 0.0,
        "backend": "faster_whisper",
        "reason": "WER 0.0%",
        "transcript": "Are you still planning to help out at the Science Fair this Saturday? Yes, but I just found out I'm assigned to judge the middle school projects instead of the high school ones. That's actually better. The younger students are usually more enthusiastic about explaining their work. True. I just need to be at the gymnasium by 8.30 to pick up my judging materials. Great. I'll see you there. I'm helping with registration at the front desk.",
