        "verdict": "PASS",
        "wer": 0.0,
        "backend": "faster_whisper",
        "reason": "WER 0.0%",
        "transcript": "Are you going to the alumni networking dinner on Friday evening? I wasn't planning to, but my advisor mentioned it might be a good opportunity to meet people in my field. Definitely. Last year I connected with someone who ended up offering me a summer position at her company. That's impressive. What time does it start? The reception begins at six, but the dinner isn't served until seven. I usually show up early to mingle.",
