        "wer": 0.0,
        "backend": "faster_whisper",
        "reason": "WER 0.0%",
        "transcript": "I have a problem. I'm supposed to present my research findings in ten minutes, but the projector in the seminar room isn't working. Did you try restarting it? Sometimes the connection just needs to be reset. I tried that. The power light comes on, but nothing displays on the screen. There's a spare projector in the supply closet down the hall. I can help you set it up if you'd like. That would save me. Let's go get it now.",
