        "wer": 0.0417,
        "backend": "faster_whisper",
        "reason": "WER 4.2% — queue for a human listen",
        "transcript": "Have you tried the new payment app they just launched for campus services? No, I haven't. What can you use it for? Pretty much everything. You can pay for meals, printing, even laundry in the dorms. It's all linked to your student account. That sounds convenient. Is it difficult to set up? Not at all. You just downloaded and logged in with your university credentials. It took me about two minutes.",
